{"index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><base href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>WordPress Studio · Independent Grocery Builder</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/shared.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\"></head><body><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Connecting to the WordPress authentication service…</strong><p>This workspace has its own Neon account and database.</p></div></div><div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-wp-templates-page\" tabindex=\"-1\"><header class=\"page-heading\"><div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">INDEPENDENT WORDPRESS WORKSPACE</p><h1>Grocery Builder</h1><p>Manage storefront designs, page content and customer orders from this separate application.</p></div></header><section class=\"hf-wpt-detail-grid\"><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Storefront templates</h2><p>Choose one of four independent grocery storefront designs and customize its pages.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-templates.html?category=ecommerce-grocery&amp;template=1\">Open templates ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website pages</h2><p>Manage the 25-page website structure and persistent page drafts.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-pages.html?template=general-supermarket\">Manage pages ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website orders</h2><p>Review customer orders and update supported fulfilment statuses.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-orders.html?template=general-supermarket\">Open orders ↗</a></article></section></main></div><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-client.js?v=6&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-auth.js?v=5&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script></body></html>","robots.txt":"User-agent: *\nAllow: /\n","admin/index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><base href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>WordPress Studio · Independent Grocery Builder</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/shared.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\"></head><body><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Connecting to the WordPress authentication service…</strong><p>This workspace has its own Neon account and database.</p></div></div><div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-wp-templates-page\" tabindex=\"-1\"><header class=\"page-heading\"><div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">INDEPENDENT WORDPRESS WORKSPACE</p><h1>Grocery Builder</h1><p>Manage storefront designs, page content and customer orders from this separate application.</p></div></header><section class=\"hf-wpt-detail-grid\"><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Storefront templates</h2><p>Choose one of four independent grocery storefront designs and customize its pages.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-templates.html?category=ecommerce-grocery&amp;template=1\">Open templates ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website pages</h2><p>Manage the 25-page website structure and persistent page drafts.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-pages.html?template=general-supermarket\">Manage pages ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website orders</h2><p>Review customer orders and update supported fulfilment statuses.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-orders.html?template=general-supermarket\">Open orders ↗</a></article></section></main></div><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-client.js?v=6&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-auth.js?v=5&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script></body></html>","admin/wordpress-templates.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Grocery Storefront Templates · WordPress Workspace</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/\" crossorigin=\"\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/shared.css?v=20261106-wordpress-categories-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=20261101-merchant-fieldbook-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-templates.css?v=20261107-multipage-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"wordpress-templates\">\n<div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>This private template library is available only to the authorized admin account.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-wp-templates-page\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<header class=\"page-heading hf-wpt-heading\"><div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">WORDPRESS · GROCERY COMMERCE STUDIO</p><h1 id=\"wpTemplateCategoryTitle\">E-commerce &amp; Grocery</h1><p id=\"wpTemplateIntro\">Four distinct storefront directions, powered by one reusable commerce foundation.</p></div><div class=\"page-actions\"><a class=\"hf-button hf-button-secondary\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-live.html\">← Back to WordPress</a></div></header>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-architecture\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-architecture-mark\">WP</div><div><strong>WordPress Builder Commerce Template System</strong><p>GitHub is the version-controlled source for storefront designs and editor code. Neon is the data layer for template catalog, website configuration, products, categories, assets and orders. Preview content is illustrative until a merchant connects their own catalog.</p></div><span class=\"hf-wpt-connection\" id=\"wpTemplateConnection\">CONNECTING TO NEON</span></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-template-bar\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-template-bar-copy\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-eyebrow\">GROCERY STOREFRONT COLLECTION</span><strong>Choose a design direction</strong></div><nav class=\"hf-wpt-template-tabs\" id=\"wpTemplateTabs\" aria-label=\"Grocery templates\"><button type=\"button\" data-template-index=\"0\" class=\"\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-tab-number\">01</span><span><strong>General Supermarket</strong><small>Everyday shopping</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" data-template-index=\"1\" class=\"\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-tab-number\">02</span><span><strong>Fresh &amp; Farm</strong><small>Farm to home</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" data-template-index=\"2\" class=\"is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-tab-number\">03</span><span><strong>Express Grocery</strong><small>Quick commerce</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" data-template-index=\"3\" class=\"\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-tab-number\">04</span><span><strong>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</strong><small>B2B supply</small></span></button></nav></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-preview-shell\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-toolbar\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-meta\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-live-dot\"></span><div><strong id=\"wpTemplateName\">Express Grocery</strong><small id=\"wpTemplateTagline\">Fast essentials, fewer steps</small></div></div><div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-actions\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-device-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Preview size\"><button type=\"button\" data-preview-device=\"desktop\" class=\"is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">▰ <span>Desktop</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-preview-device=\"mobile\" aria-pressed=\"false\">▯ <span>Mobile</span></button></div><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplatePages\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-pages.html?template=express-grocery\">Explore 25 pages ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplateUse\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-builder.html?template=express-grocery\">Customize design ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button hf-wpt-browser-button\" id=\"wpTemplateBrowserTop\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/storefront.html?site=hf-general-supermarket&amp;preview=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See Website with Browser ↗</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"hf-wpt-browserbar\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-browser-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"hf-wpt-lock\">▣</span><span class=\"hf-wpt-browser-address\" id=\"wpTemplateAddress\">preview://grocery/express-grocery</span><span class=\"hf-wpt-browser-label\">PREVIEW</span></div>\n<div class=\"hf-wpt-viewport is-desktop\" id=\"wpTemplateViewport\"><div class=\"hf-storefront\" id=\"wpStorefront\" data-template=\"express-grocery\"><div class=\"hf-express-ribbon\">Fast local delivery <b>·</b> Essentials at your door</div><header class=\"hf-express-header\"><div class=\"hf-express-logo\"><span>zip</span>mart.</div><div class=\"hf-express-location\">⌖ Delivering to <b>Your area</b>⌄</div><button class=\"hf-express-cart\">Bag <b id=\"hfShopCart\">0</b></button></header><div class=\"hf-express-search\"><span>⌕</span><input id=\"hfShopSearch\" placeholder=\"What do you need today?\" value=\"\"></div><section class=\"hf-express-hero\"><div><small>YOUR DAILY QUICK STOP</small><h2>Need it now? We're on the way.</h2><p>Everyday essentials, snacks and fresh favourites — added in seconds and delivered nearby.</p><button data-scroll-products=\"\">Shop essentials →</button></div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604719312566-8912e9c8a213?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1500&amp;q=85\" alt=\"Convenience grocery essentials\"></section><div class=\"hf-express-benefits\"><span>⚡ Quick add</span><span>◷ Local delivery</span><span>✓ Everyday essentials</span></div><nav class=\"hf-express-cats\"><button data-category=\"Popular\">Popular</button><button data-category=\"Snacks\">Snacks</button><button data-category=\"Drinks\">Drinks</button><button data-category=\"Daily needs\">Daily needs</button><button data-category=\"Fresh\">Fresh</button><button data-category=\"Household\">Household</button></nav><section class=\"hf-express-products\" id=\"hfShopProducts\"><div class=\"hf-express-title\"><div><small>READY WHEN YOU ARE</small><h3>Popular right now</h3></div><span>6 picks</span></div><div class=\"hf-express-grid\"><article class=\"hf-express-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523362628745-0c100150b504?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Sparkling water\"><div><small>Drinks</small><strong>Sparkling water</strong><b>৳45</b><span>/can</span></div><button data-add=\"0\">+ Add</button></article><article class=\"hf-express-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566478989037-eec170784d0b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Potato crisps\"><div><small>Snacks</small><strong>Potato crisps</strong><b>৳55</b><span>/pack</span></div><button data-add=\"1\">+ Add</button></article><article class=\"hf-express-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563636619-e9143da7973b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fresh milk\"><div><small>Daily needs</small><strong>Fresh milk</strong><b>৳95</b><span>/litre</span></div><button data-add=\"2\">+ Add</button></article><article class=\"hf-express-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571771894821-ce9b6c11b08e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Bananas\"><div><small>Fresh</small><strong>Bananas</strong><b>৳80</b><span>/dozen</span></div><button data-add=\"3\">+ Add</button></article><article class=\"hf-express-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585421514738-01798e348b17?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Dish wash liquid\"><div><small>Household</small><strong>Dish wash liquid</strong><b>৳125</b><span>/bottle</span></div><button data-add=\"4\">+ Add</button></article><article class=\"hf-express-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548907040-4d42cfcf7f2b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Chocolate bar\"><div><small>Snacks</small><strong>Chocolate bar</strong><b>৳60</b><span>/piece</span></div><button data-add=\"5\">+ Add</button></article></div></section><div class=\"hf-express-sticky\"><div><small>YOUR BAG</small><strong><span id=\"hfShopCart\">0</span> items added</strong></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"hf-express-viewbag\">View bag →</button></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-footer\"><span>Interactive storefront concept · sample products and prices only</span><span id=\"wpTemplateFeatureSummary\">Quick add · sticky cart · fast local delivery</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-detail-grid\" id=\"wpTemplateDetails\"><article><small>DESIGN APPROACH</small><h3>Compact product cards · quick-add flows</h3><p>A compact, high-velocity convenience experience with instant add controls, short category rails, reorder shortcuts and a persistent cart for quick local delivery.</p></article><article><small>BEST FOR</small><h3>Quick commerce</h3><p>Convenience stores, express grocery and local delivery shops</p></article><article><small>COMMERCE FEATURES</small><ul><li>Compact, scan-friendly catalogue</li><li>One-tap quick add</li><li>Sticky basket and quantity controls</li><li>Repeat-order shortcuts</li><li>Delivery-zone messaging</li></ul></article></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-next-step\"><div><span class=\"hf-wpt-eyebrow\">NEXT STEP</span><h2>Make this storefront yours</h2><p>Open the visual editor with this design direction selected. Your working draft is isolated from every other storefront until you choose to publish it.</p></div><div class=\"hf-wpt-bottom-actions\"><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplatePagesBottom\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-pages.html?template=express-grocery\">Manage all 25 pages ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplateUseBottom\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-builder.html?template=express-grocery\">Open in Website Builder ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button hf-wpt-browser-button\" id=\"wpTemplateBrowserBottom\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/storefront.html?site=hf-express-grocery&amp;preview=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See Website with Browser ↗</a></div></section>\n</main></div>\n\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-client.js?v=6&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-auth.js?v=5&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=20261107-owner-lock-v2&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script>\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-templates.js?v=20261107-multipage-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script>\n</body></html>","admin/website-pages.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>Website Pages · WordPress Workspace</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/shared.css?v=20261106-wordpress-categories-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=20261101-merchant-fieldbook-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-pages.css?v=20261107-multipage-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"wordpress\"><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>Website pages are available only to the authorized admin account.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-pages-page\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<header class=\"hf-pages-header\"><div><span class=\"hf-pages-kicker\">MULTI-PAGE STORE BUILDER</span><h1 id=\"hfPagesTitle\">Website Pages</h1><p id=\"hfPagesIntro\">A complete storefront with 25 connected page designs—not just a landing page.</p></div><div class=\"hf-pages-actions\"><a class=\"hf-pages-btn secondary\" id=\"hfOrdersLink\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-orders.html?template=general-supermarket\">View orders</a><a class=\"hf-pages-btn secondary\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-templates.html?category=ecommerce-grocery\">Template library</a><a class=\"hf-pages-btn secondary\" id=\"hfPagesPreview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Preview website ↗</a><button class=\"hf-pages-btn\" id=\"hfPublishSite\" type=\"button\">Publish website</button></div></header>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-status\" id=\"hfPagesStatus\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Connecting to Neon…</section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-stats\" id=\"hfPagesStats\"></section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-onboarding\" id=\"hfPagesOnboarding\"></section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-section\"><div class=\"hf-pages-section-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-pages-kicker\">DESIGNED PAGE LIBRARY</span><h2>Core website pages</h2><p>25 page designs are included in each theme. Product and category pages are connected to the live catalogue.</p></div><span class=\"hf-pages-count\" id=\"hfCorePageCount\">25 PAGES</span></div><div class=\"hf-pages-grid\" id=\"hfCorePages\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-section\"><div class=\"hf-pages-section-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-pages-kicker\">GROW YOUR WEBSITE</span><h2>Custom pages</h2><p>Create more pages for campaigns, policies, guides and stories.</p></div></div><form class=\"hf-pages-custom\" id=\"hfCustomPageForm\"><label for=\"hfCustomPageTitle\">New page title</label><input id=\"hfCustomPageTitle\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"e.g. Our Sourcing Standards\" required=\"\"><button class=\"hf-pages-btn\" type=\"submit\">Add page +</button></form><div class=\"hf-pages-grid\" id=\"hfCustomPages\"></div></section>\n<footer class=\"hf-pages-footer\">GitHub stores the storefront renderer and theme design. Neon stores each website, its 25 page documents, catalogue and customer orders. Preview is private; publish is a separate action.</footer>\n</main></div>\n\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-client.js?v=6&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-auth.js?v=5&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=20261107-owner-lock-v2&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-pages.js?v=20261107-multipage-v3&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script>\n</body></html>","admin/website-orders.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Website Orders · WordPress Workspace</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/shared.css?v=20261106-wordpress-categories-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=20261101-merchant-fieldbook-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-orders.css?v=20261107-orders-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n</head><body data-page=\"wordpress\"><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>Only the authorized website owner can view these orders.</p></div></div><div id=\"adminApp\"><main class=\"hf-orders-page\" id=\"pageContent\" tabindex=\"-1\"><header class=\"hf-orders-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-orders-kicker\">NEON COMMERCE · PRIVATE ADMIN</span><h1 id=\"hfOrdersTitle\">Website Orders</h1><p>Orders placed through this storefront. Customer information is visible only to the website owner.</p></div><div class=\"hf-orders-actions\"><a class=\"hf-orders-btn secondary\" id=\"hfBackPages\">Website pages</a><a class=\"hf-orders-btn secondary\" id=\"hfPublicSite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Storefront ↗</a></div></header><div id=\"hfOrdersStatus\" class=\"hf-orders-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Connecting to Neon…</div><section class=\"hf-orders-summary\" id=\"hfOrdersSummary\"></section><section class=\"hf-orders-tools\"><input id=\"hfOrdersSearch\" type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search orders by order number, customer or phone\" placeholder=\"Search order, customer or phone…\"><select id=\"hfOrdersFilter\" aria-label=\"Filter orders by status\"><option value=\"all\">All statuses</option><option value=\"pending\">Pending</option><option value=\"processing\">Processing</option><option value=\"shipped\">Shipped</option><option value=\"delivered\">Delivered</option><option value=\"cancelled\">Cancelled</option></select><button id=\"hfOrdersRefresh\" class=\"hf-orders-btn\" type=\"button\">Refresh</button></section><section id=\"hfOrdersList\" class=\"hf-orders-list\"></section></main></div>\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-client.js?v=6&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-auth.js?v=5&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=20261107-owner-lock-v2&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-orders.js?v=20261107-orders-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script></body></html>","admin/wordpress-live.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/\" crossorigin=\"\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<title>Live Website · Sandbox · WordPress Workspace</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/shared.css?v=20261106-wordpress-categories-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress.css?v=20261105-sandbox-partitions-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=20261101-merchant-fieldbook-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"wordpress\">\n<div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\">\n  <div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>This private sandbox is available only after the authorized owner account is confirmed.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"adminApp\">\n<main id=\"pageContent\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"hf-wordpress-page hf-sandbox-page\">\n  <header class=\"page-heading hf-wordpress-heading\">\n    <div class=\"hf-wordpress-heading-copy\">\n      <p class=\"page-eyebrow\">WEBSITE STUDIO · PRIVATE SANDBOX</p>\n      <h1>Live Website</h1>\n      <p>View the version published inside this admin dashboard. This is not the public WordPress storefront.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"page-actions hf-wordpress-heading-actions\">\n      <a class=\"hf-button hf-button-primary\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-builder.html\">✎ Edit Website</a>\n      <button class=\"hf-button hf-button-secondary\" id=\"wpSandboxRefresh\" type=\"button\">↻ Refresh sandbox</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"hf-sandbox-safety\" role=\"note\">\n    <strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\">▣</span> Isolated testing environment</strong>\n    <span>Changes and Test Publish are stored only in this browser's dashboard storage. No production website, customer data, orders, payment services, live APIs or deployment endpoints are connected.</span>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"hf-card hf-review-panel hf-sandbox-review\" id=\"wpSandboxReview\" aria-label=\"Test draft review\">\n    <div class=\"hf-review-heading\">\n      <div><span class=\"hf-review-kicker\">TEST REVIEW WORKFLOW</span><h2 id=\"wpSandboxReviewTitle\">Draft awaiting review</h2><p id=\"wpSandboxReviewMeta\">A draft sent from Edit Website will appear here.</p></div>\n      <span class=\"hf-review-status\" id=\"wpSandboxReviewState\">AWAITING REVIEW</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hf-sandbox-review-preview\">\n      <div id=\"wpSandboxReviewFrame\" title=\"Isolated test draft preview\" sandbox=\"\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" data-original-tag=\"iframe\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hf-review-actions\">\n      <button class=\"hf-button hf-button-secondary\" id=\"wpSandboxViewDraft\" type=\"button\">View submitted draft</button>\n      <button class=\"hf-button hf-button-primary\" id=\"wpSandboxApprove\" type=\"button\">Approve for Test Publish</button>\n      <button class=\"hf-button hf-button-primary\" id=\"wpSandboxPublish\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\">Publish Test Version</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hf-review-safety\">Approval and Test Publish affect only this dashboard sandbox. They cannot deploy or update the real website.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"hf-card hf-wordpress-toolbar\" aria-label=\"Test website preview controls\">\n    <div class=\"hf-wordpress-toolbar-copy\">\n      <div class=\"hf-wordpress-toolbar-title\"><span class=\"hf-sandbox-live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>Test Published Version</strong></div>\n      <p id=\"wpSandboxPublishedMeta\">No Test Published Version yet.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hf-wordpress-toolbar-actions\">\n      <div class=\"hf-wordpress-device-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose sandbox preview size\">\n        <button class=\"hf-wordpress-device-button is-active\" type=\"button\" data-sandbox-view=\"desktop\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Desktop view\"><span>▰</span> Desktop</button>\n        <button class=\"hf-wordpress-device-button\" type=\"button\" data-sandbox-view=\"mobile\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mobile view\"><span>▯</span> Mobile</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"hf-wordpress-browserbar\">\n    <div class=\"hf-wordpress-browser-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n    <span class=\"hf-wordpress-browser-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▣</span>\n    <div class=\"hf-wordpress-address\">dashboard://sandbox/published-test-version</div>\n    <span class=\"hf-wordpress-browser-label hf-sandbox-label\">SANDBOX</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"hf-wordpress-preview-stage hf-sandbox-stage\" id=\"wpSandboxStage\" aria-label=\"Published test version preview\">\n    <div class=\"hf-sandbox-empty\" id=\"wpSandboxEmpty\">\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">▱</span>\n      <h2>No test version published yet</h2>\n      <p>Open Edit Website, make a change, send it for review, approve it, and publish a test version. It will appear here without touching the public website.</p>\n      <a class=\"hf-button hf-button-primary\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-builder.html\">Start editing</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hf-wordpress-device-shell is-desktop hf-sandbox-device\" id=\"wpSandboxDevice\">\n      <div id=\"wpSandboxFrame\" title=\"Dashboard-only published test version\" sandbox=\"\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" data-original-tag=\"iframe\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"hf-card hf-sandbox-history-card\">\n    <div class=\"hf-sandbox-history-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-review-kicker\">VERSION CONTROL</span><h2>Test Version History</h2><p>Versions saved in this browser only. No production backups or deployments are created.</p></div></div>\n    <ol id=\"wpSandboxHistory\" class=\"hf-sandbox-history\"><li>No test versions yet.</li></ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"hf-wordpress-preview-foot\">\n    <span id=\"wpSandboxStatus\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Sandbox ready</span>\n    <span>“Live Website” means the dashboard's Test Published Version only. The public WordPress storefront remains unchanged.</span>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-client.js?v=6&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-auth.js?v=5&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-sandbox.js?v=20261105-sandbox-partitions-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script>\n\n\n</body></html>","admin/website-builder.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Universal Website Builder · WordPress Workspace</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/\" crossorigin=\"\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/shared.css?v=20261106-wordpress-categories-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=20261101-merchant-fieldbook-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-builder.css?v=20261105-sandbox-partitions-v1&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?_ship=bv6dsk2\">\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"wordpress\">\n<div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>The isolated editor opens only after the authorized owner account is confirmed.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"adminApp\">\n<main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-builder-page\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n  <header class=\"hf-builder-topbar\">\n    <div class=\"hf-builder-brand\">\n      <a href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/wordpress-live.html\" id=\"builderBackLink\" class=\"hf-builder-back\" aria-label=\"Back to WordPress Studio\">←</a>\n      <div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">UNIVERSAL WEBSITE BUILDER</p><h1>Edit Website <span class=\"hf-builder-lab\">SANDBOX</span></h1></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hf-builder-top-actions\">\n      <a class=\"hf-builder-btn\" id=\"builderPagesLink\" href=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-pages.html?template=general-supermarket\">All website pages ↗</a>\n      <span class=\"hf-builder-save-state\" id=\"builderSaveState\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><i></i> Sandbox draft · not public</span>\n      <button class=\"hf-builder-btn\" id=\"builderUndo\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Undo\">↶</button>\n      <button class=\"hf-builder-btn\" id=\"builderRedo\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Redo\">↷</button>\n      <button class=\"hf-builder-btn\" id=\"builderReset\" type=\"button\">Reset sample</button>\n      <button class=\"hf-builder-btn\" id=\"builderExport\" type=\"button\">Export JSON ↓</button>\n      <button class=\"hf-builder-btn hf-builder-btn-primary\" id=\"builderSendPreview\" type=\"button\">Send for test review ↗</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n <div class=\"hf-builder-security-strip\" role=\"note\"><strong>WordPress Builder · isolated workspace</strong><span>1. GitHub stores versioned builder and template code</span><span>2. Neon is the durable commerce data layer (project super-glade-83751859)</span><span>3. Neon stores durable website drafts; browser storage is an offline recovery copy only</span><span>4. Test Publish never changes the public website or production data</span></div>\n\n  <section class=\"hf-builder-workspace\" aria-label=\"Visual website editor\">\n    <aside class=\"hf-builder-left\">\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-builder-kicker\">BUILD</span><h2>Elements</h2></div><span class=\"hf-builder-count\" id=\"builderElementCount\">0</span></div>\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Builder panel\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"is-active\" data-builder-tab=\"elements\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Add elements</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-builder-tab=\"layers\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Layers</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-tab-panel\" id=\"builderElementsPanel\">\n        <p class=\"hf-builder-panel-note\">Add flexible building blocks to your page. This starter uses a controlled component library.</p>\n        <div class=\"hf-builder-component-grid\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-add-component=\"section\"><span class=\"hf-builder-component-icon\">▱</span><strong>Section</strong><small>Full-width area</small></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-add-component=\"container\"><span class=\"hf-builder-component-icon\">▣</span><strong>Container</strong><small>Content wrapper</small></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-add-component=\"heading\"><span class=\"hf-builder-component-icon\">T</span><strong>Heading</strong><small>Title text</small></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-add-component=\"paragraph\"><span class=\"hf-builder-component-icon\">¶</span><strong>Paragraph</strong><small>Body text</small></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-add-component=\"image\"><span class=\"hf-builder-component-icon\">▧</span><strong>Image</strong><small>Visual media</small></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-add-component=\"button\"><span class=\"hf-builder-component-icon\">▰</span><strong>Button</strong><small>Call to action</small></button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hf-builder-safe-note\"><strong>Safe by design</strong><span>Blocks are schema-driven. Arbitrary scripts and unsafe HTML are not executed.</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-tab-panel\" id=\"builderLayersPanel\">\n        <p class=\"hf-builder-panel-note\">Select an element to edit its properties.</p>\n        <div id=\"builderLayers\" class=\"hf-builder-layers\" role=\"tree\" aria-label=\"Page layers\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <section class=\"hf-builder-center\" aria-label=\"Page canvas\">\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-canvas-toolbar\">\n        <div><span class=\"hf-builder-kicker\">CANVAS</span><strong id=\"builderPageTitle\">Untitled landing page</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"hf-builder-device-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Canvas viewport\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-builder-viewport=\"desktop\" class=\"is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\" title=\"Desktop viewport\">▰ <span>Desktop</span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-builder-viewport=\"tablet\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"Tablet viewport\">▯ <span>Tablet</span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-builder-viewport=\"mobile\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"Mobile viewport\">▯ <span>Mobile</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-canvas-scroll\">\n        <div class=\"hf-builder-canvas-frame is-desktop\" id=\"builderCanvasFrame\">\n          <div id=\"builderCanvas\" class=\"hf-builder-canvas\" aria-label=\"Editable page canvas\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-canvas-foot\"><span>Draft canvas</span><span>Click an element to select · Edit properties on the right</span></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <aside class=\"hf-builder-right\">\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-panel-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-builder-kicker\">CUSTOMIZE</span><h2>Properties</h2></div><span class=\"hf-builder-selected-tag\" id=\"builderSelectedType\">PAGE</span></div>\n      <div id=\"builderInspector\" class=\"hf-builder-inspector\">\n        <div class=\"hf-builder-inspector-empty\"><span>✳</span><strong>Select an element</strong><p>Choose a block on the canvas or in Layers to edit its content and appearance.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hf-builder-right-foot\"><span>Document model v1</span><span>Preview only · no live changes</span></div>\n    </aside>\n  </section>\n  <footer class=\"hf-builder-footer\"><span><i></i> Sandbox editor · no production connection</span><span>Edit here → Send for test review → Approve → Publish Test Version. The public website remains unchanged.</span></footer>\n</main>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-client.js?v=6&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-auth.js?v=5&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=20261107-owner-lock-v2&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script>\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"https://wordpress-studio.shipstatic.com/admin/website-builder.js?v=20261107-multipage-v2&amp;_ship=bv6dsk2\"></script>\n\n</body></html>"}